+ *   gpio_keys/vol_up = <&pm660l_gpios 7 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>: PM660L is SID 2
+ *   and pin 7 is gpio@c600 (qcom,mode = 0, input), so PPID 0x2c6 and the
+ *   level is INT_RT_STS (0xc610) bit 0, low when pressed.
+ * The camera_focus / camera_snapshot entries of the same node are TLMM
+ * GPIOs 64 / 113 inherited from the reference board; lavender has no
+ * camera key, so they are not polled.
+ * WHYRED (SDM636) builds with ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_LAVENDER too; its PMIC
+ * pair is the same, but its key wiring has not been checked against its
+ * DTB. A wrong GPIO only withholds volume-up (see the enable check below).
  */
